        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "OpenSSL SHA-256 as the project's workhorse hash: Bitcoin_SHA256 (hash.c:3-9) and Bitcoin_DoubleSHA256 (hash.c:11-21, two rounds — the Bitcoin txid/hash-style construction). Grover only halves SHA-256's work factor; 128-bit quantum collision resistance keeps it post-quantum-acceptable, hence rating A-, but it is a genuine, reachable primitive here and belongs in the inventory. Same hash feeds address derivation (main.c) and base58check checksums (base58.c) through these wrappers."
